  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞将{F4 84 04 01 01 01 B7 07}\n　交给了伊丽莎白。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_630.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 0C 01 02 01 01 01 07 01}{F5 86 22 01 03 01 05 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 35 11}哎呀，伊织顺平先生、巽完二先生也来了。\n是来报告委托的吗？\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_630.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 08 01 02 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 86 0C 01 0B 01 03 01 07 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 A8 08}是啊，那个……\n可让我们吃了好大的苦头。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e800/e822_630.bf.json:3:0",
